  "details": "# Issue:\nSorting Options, e.g. what Friend Group to show or what to sort it by still sync between the Quick and Main Menu.\n# Suggestion:\nWhen `Wing Persistence` is disabled, none of the settings / sorting options / filters for them should be persistent so each wing can be different.\nThis would also make it more consistent with when you have the same wing open on both sides, than they also each have their own settings.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/34hh3n",
